@startuml screening-plan-model-uz
hide circle
hide empty members
left to right direction
title Skrining rejasi yozuv bilan qanday bog'langan

class "ServiceRequest (reja)" as ScreeningPlan [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-servicerequest.html{UZ Core ServiceRequest profilini ochish}]]
class PlanDefinition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-plan-definition.html{UZ Core PlanDefinition profilini ochish}]]
class ActivityDefinition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-activitydefinition.html{UZ Core ActivityDefinition profilini ochish}]]
class ScreeningPatient [[StructureDefinition-screening-patient.html{ScreeningPatient profilini ochish}]] #E8F0FE
class "QuestionnaireResponse,\nScreeningObservation,\nScreeningDiagnosticReport,\nScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure,\nScreeningServiceRequest" as Evidence #E8F0FE
class ScreeningSpecimen [[StructureDefinition-screening-specimen.html{ScreeningSpecimen profilini ochish}]] #E8F0FE
class Condition [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-condition.html{UZ Core Condition profilini ochish}]]

Evidence "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPlan : « basedOn »
ScreeningSpecimen "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPlan : « request »
Condition "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPlan : « extension[event-basedOn] »
ScreeningPlan "0..*" --> "1" ScreeningPatient : « subject »
ScreeningPlan "0..*" --> "0..1" PlanDefinition : « instantiatesCanonical »
PlanDefinition "0..*" --> "0..*" ActivityDefinition : « action.definitionCanonical »

caption Klinik resurslar reja bilan birga bevosita yo'llanmaga havolani ham saqlaydi.
@enduml
